    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exciting opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom bungalow in the highly regarded Dunbur Glen area of Wicklow Town, enjoying wonderful sea views and offering enormous potential for those looking to create their ideal home.\r\n\r\nWhile the property requires upgrading and modernisation, its attractive setting, single-storey accommodation and stunning outlook provide an excellent foundation for a rewarding renovation project. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation, with three bedrooms and generous living space, and would suit buyers seeking to put their own stamp on a home in a sought-after coastal location. There is a block built garage to the rear. \r\n\r\nThe elevated position takes full advantage of the views towards the sea, while the surrounding area offers a peaceful residential setting yet remains within easy reach of Wicklow Town and its wide range of amenities, including shops, cafés, schools, sporting facilities and transport links.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this combination of sea views, generous accommodation and refurbishment potential rarely come to the market and this bungalow is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the location, views and potential this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Block built garage\r\nOff street parking\r\n3 bedrooms\r\nDetached bulgalow\r\n1 minute walk to the beach\r\nWicklow Golf Club is 10 seconds drive\r\nViews over the sea\r\n\r\nBER: 119692317"
      },
      {
